# App secrets — NEVER commit these (FinCalc has no backend keys by design;
# the Firebase google-services.json IS committed: it is a public client
# config, not a secret, and CI needs it to build)
# local.properties is gitignored above.
# Firebase + AdMob IDs live in app code (AdMobManager.kt / AndroidManifest.xml)
# and in app/google-services.json — never copy them into docs or chat.
